 words=[('puruṣeṇa haviṣā','<b>with the Puruṣa as the offering</b>'),('yajñam atanvata','<b>spread out the sacrifice</b>'),('vasantaḥ · ājyam','<b>spring</b> · <b>ghee</b>'),('grīṣmaḥ · idhmaḥ','<b>summer</b> · <b>firewood</b>'),('śarad · haviḥ','<b>autumn</b> · <b>oblation</b>')],
 point='<b>Creation as a sacrifice.</b> This is the hymn’s great image: the world comes from an act of giving. Time itself, the turning year, is the ritual. Every season “burns” to keep the world going.',
